  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Policy Dialogues for Reforms:Socio-Economic Policy Dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&#x2019;s expected effect(s) on society is: Reform oriented Socio-economic dialogue among high level political figures from different genders and religious affiliations in Lebanon is enhanced and strengthened (Impact).
The expected effects for the target group of the Project is: 
 - Create a trusted, scientific, and unbiased platform for economic policy dialogue among high level political figures.
- With the buy-in of parties who engaged in dialogue, produce a policy plan for economic reforms that addresses areas of focus selected based on urgency of intervention and room for breakthrough.</narrative>
  </description>
